:"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残りの授業日がんばるぞぉ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは修学旅行のときの写真の1部を公開しちゃいまーす!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3716781/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番上は厳島神社にて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまの名付け親であるお友達が撮ってくれました(*^-^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下の左の写真は、平清盛さんになって撮りました(  ＾∀＾)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、下の右の写真は金閣寺にて＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お天気も良くて、水面も波がなく静かでとっても綺麗な金閣寺でした+"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"修学旅行の夜は、友達の恋話の聞き役に徹していたつもりが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたら寝てしまっていました( ´_ゝ`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達に後から聞いた話ですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「日奈起きてる?」っと友達が言うと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「うん。起きてるよ。。」と日奈。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「じゃあ今話してたこと言ってみて(笑)」と友達。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すると日奈は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「豆腐屋さんの話でしょ。。」って言ったそうです( ´_ゝ`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆腐屋さんの話なんて一度もしていないのに...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそのまま、パタッと寝てしまったそうです(-_-)zzz笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈は全く記憶にないの...( ´_ゝ`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後から聞いてびっくりしました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、日だまりのお部屋で日奈とtallkig たいむ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.八つ橋の皮って何だ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.生八つ橋の中身がない、皮の部分だけのものだよー＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごい美味しいの(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中でも抹茶が日奈は大好き＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスをくるんで食べたりしました+"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.まりかと川後のひなさんと遊んだときに飲んでたタピオカは、何味?やっぱり抹茶かな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.はい...やっぱり抹茶です(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抹茶味のタピオカを温めてもらいました＊美味しかったですよぉ(●^o^●)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.静岡住みだよー♪今度静岡のお茶飲んでみてー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.そうなんですか( ゜o゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈のいとこも静岡県に住んでます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"静岡茶美味しいですよね...*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ライブに向けて、ひなちゃんの団扇作ろうと思ってて